OL,3,GNEWSAFirefighters tackle fire at bike
OL,4,Afactory
OL,5,
OL,6,FAbout 30 firefighters have been
OL,7,Ftackling a blaze at a bike factory
OL,8,Fwhich has left the owners
OL,9,F"heartbroken".
OL,11,FCrews were called to Atherton Bikes at
OL,12,FTreowain business park in Machynlleth,
OL,13,FPowys on Sunday at 08:00 BST.
OL,15,FA plume of grey smoke was seen over the
OL,16,Ftown with residents advised to keep
OL,17,Fdoors and windows closed.
OL,19,FWorld champion mountain bikers Gee and
OL,20,FRachel Atherton said they were
OL,21,F"devastated" for their staff and
OL,22,Fcustomers.
OL,23,APub: 11-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
